  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wif">Wif</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hit swa geforword bið, þonne is riht, ðæt heo sy healfes yrfes wyrðe — 7 ealles, gif hy cild gemæne habban —, bute heo eft wær ceose.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if it is thus contracted, then it is right that she should be entitled to half the goods – and to all, if they have a child together – unless she marries again.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hit swa geforword bið, ðonne is riht, þæt heo sy healfes orfes wyrðe – 7 ealles, gif hy cild gemæne habban –, bute heo eft wær ceose.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
